# era-hotel-pms — module map

Entitlement keys: `hotel_distribution`, `hotel_banquets` (see `docs/adr/hotel-module-taxonomy.md`).

**Acceptance SSOT:** [Hotel-Acceptance-System](../../../docs/acceptance/Hotel-Acceptance-System.md) · [Product-Readiness](../../../docs/acceptance/Hotel-Product-Readiness-Matrix.md) · [Implementation-Matrix](../../../docs/acceptance/Hotel-Implementation-Matrix.md) · edition [`docs/editions/hotel.yaml`](../../../docs/editions/hotel.yaml)

## Menu IA canon

SSOT: [`doc/MENU-IA-CANON.md`](../../doc/MENU-IA-CANON.md) — FO=`/fo/*`, HK=`/hk/*`, Cash=`/front-cash/*`, NA=`/night-audit/*`, Distribution=`/distribution/*`, Settings=`/settings/*`.

## Front office chain

| Route | API | Role |
|-------|-----|------|
| /fo/availability | GET /api/fo/room-type-availability, GET /api/fo/sellable | Sellable Avl/Occ; create preview |
| /fo/reservations | reservations grid | Stay list / arrivals |
| /fo/rack | rack | Door tiles |
| /fo/room-plan | room-plan API | Timeline bars |

## hotel_distribution (H-BL-30)

| Route | API | Role |
|-------|-----|------|
| `/distribution/contracts` | `GET/POST /api/admin/contracts`, `GET/PATCH /api/admin/contracts/:id`, `?utilization=1` | B2B sales contract CRUD + pick-up |
| `/distribution/allotment-blocks` | `GET/POST /api/admin/allotment-blocks`, `GET/PATCH …/:id` (+`?pickup=1`), `POST …/:id/pickup` | Corporate blocks + pickup to booking |
| `/distribution/channel` | `GET/POST/DELETE /api/channel/*`, `GET /api/channel/health`, `POST /api/channel/ota-cancel`, sync push/pull | Local CM (HOT-CH-01); live OTA STUB (HOT-CH-02) |
| Groups / booking envelope | `GET/POST /api/reservation-groups`, `POST /api/reservation-groups/book`, `GET/PATCH/POST /api/reservation-groups/:id` | Booking = group; `/book` = envelope + N stays; POST id = add RoomStay |
| Add room from stay | `POST /api/reservations/:id/add-room` | Ensure Booking group if missing, clone sibling RoomStay |
| Cutoff release | `POST /api/cron/allotment-block-cutoff` | HEADLESS soft-release past cutoff |
| Reservation card | `salesContractId` on `POST /api/reservations`, `PATCH …/full` | Tag booking under contract; StaysBar + names-incomplete gate |
| `/admin/contract-pricing` | 410 redirect | Legacy — use `/admin/contracts` |
| `/reports/agency-ledger`, `/reports/agency-profitability` | Finance city ledger reports | Agency AR boundary |

## hotel_banquets (H-BL-31)

| Route | API | Role |
|-------|-----|------|
| `/banquets` | `GET/POST /api/banquets` | BEO list + create |
| `/banquets/[id]` | tabs: lines, resources, staff, settlement | Event order detail |
| `/banquets/[id]/lines` | `POST /api/banquets/:id/lines` | Menu / AV / room rental lines |
| `/banquets/[id]/resources` | `POST /api/banquets/:id/resources` | Saloon / breakout calendar |
| `/banquets/[id]/staff` | `POST /api/banquets/:id/staff` | Staff assignments |
| `/banquets/[id]/settlement` | master folio planned vs actual | Settlement tab |
| `/banquets/calendar` | `GET /api/banquets/calendar` | Multi-saloon month view |
| `/banquets/reports/profitability` | `GET /api/reports/event-profitability` | Event P&L |

Cross-app: fb-pos tickets with `beoId` — extras only on event day; base package on PMS master folio.

## MDM guest identity (W4)

| Route | API | Role |
|-------|-----|------|
| Guest card Details tab | `GET /api/mdm/person-ops-profile?globalPersonId=` | Masked FIN/passport from MDM |
| Guest card merge | `POST /api/mdm/person-merge` | Foreigner → citizen FIN merge |
| Guest create/edit | `POST /api/guests`, `PATCH /api/guests/:id/full` | Transient identity → `linkPersonIdentity`; no local FIN/passport columns |

Env: `ERA_HOTEL_GUEST_MDM_STRICT=true` in production templates (see `docs/ECOSYSTEM_URLS.md`).

## CP workforce staff provision (Plan C)

| Route | API | Role |
|-------|-----|------|
| (event consumer) | `POST /api/integration/staff-provision` | Upsert `User` keyed on `cpEmploymentId`; map `satelliteRole` → local RBAC |
| (internal bind) | `GET/POST /api/internal/v1/organization/bind` | Orchestrator Sync — persist deployment `organizationId` (ADR satellite-organization-bind) |

Policy: hire master = orchestrator CP; hotel admin user create remains secondary seat guard only.

## Settlement hub (unified Front Cash)

| Route | API | Role |
|-------|-----|------|
| `/front-cash/pending` | `GET /api/settlement/pending`, `POST …/[id]/pay`, `POST …/[id]/void` | Reception queue for department walk-in charges |
| `/front-cash/transactions` | `GET /api/front-cash/transactions?from&to&cashShiftId` | Cash journal + shift filter + Z summary + close (HOT-CASH-06) |
| `/front-cash/agency-ledger` | agency ledger + `GET/POST /api/agencies/[id]/city-ledger-snapshot` | Agency CL ops + Finance re-push (HOT-CL-03/04) |
| `/folio/[reservationId]` | `POST /api/folios/settle`, deposits, void charge, BANK_TRANSFER | Guest folio settle (HOT-CASH-01) |
| `/night-audit` | pending count badge + NA pre-check / run | Night Audit core (HOT-NA-01); polish H-BL-44 |
| `/night-audit/reports` | hub (P1 grids + no-show / room-move / VIP + ops) | EOD reports pack (HOT-NA-03) |
| `/night-audit/reports/[report]` | `GET /api/night-audit/eod-reports?type&date` | cancelled / created / folio-transactions / room-price-control / no-shows / room-moves / vip-in-house (+ CSV) |
| `/night-audit/reservation-updates` | `GET …/reservation-updates?from&to&action&format=csv` | Filters + CSV (HOT-NA-04) |
| `/night-audit/year-end` | `GET|POST /api/night-audit/year-end` | Staged — ADR `hotel-year-end-calendar`; HOT-NA-05 STUB |
| `/night-audit/logs` | `GET /api/reports/night-audit-runs` | End of day logs |
| `/night-audit/inhouse-daily` | in-house daily report (`?date=`) | NA report 01 |
| Bridge in | `POST /api/settlement/pending` | fb-pos / clinic create pending (`POS_BRIDGE_SECRET`) |

Env: `FNB_POS_URL`, `CLINIC_URL` for settlement-confirmed callbacks. ADR: `docs/adr/unified-settlement-hub.md`.

## hotel_transfers / hotel_banquets (MVP)

| Route | Status |
|-------|--------|
| `/transfers`, `/transfers/airport` | SHIPPED — folio routing charge, cancel/void, day-board print (HOT-XFER-01) |
